  "answer": "According to Carnegie Mellon's staff handbook:\n\n- **Unpaid meal periods**: at least one half-hour, but not more than one hour [1][2].\n- **Paid break time**: scheduled breaks are optional and determined by each department; if scheduled, breaks are limited to **15 minutes per day** and are paid [1].\n\nNote: The evidence does not confirm whether breaks are scheduled in any particular area—that is determined by each department and known by your supervisor [1].",
